===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[complete]] (something).
#: {{ux|en|Be sure to '''finish''' your homework before you go to bed!}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To apply a treatment to {{qualifier|a surface or similar}}.
#: {{ux|en|The furniture was '''finished''' in teak veneer.}}
#* {{RQ:Churchill Celebrity|chapter=10|passage=Mr. Cooke had had a sloop yacht built at Far Harbor, the completion of which had been delayed, and which was but just delivered. […] The Maria had a cabin, which was '''finished''' in hard wood and yellow plush, and accommodations for keeping things cold.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|year=1961|month=February|title=New "Mini-Buffets" from Wolverton|journal=Trains Illustrated|page=79|text=Seats are trimmed in a grey and blue moquette and tables are '''finished''' with grey Vyanide tops, gilt edging and ebony legs.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To change an animal's food supply in the months before it is due for slaughter, with the intention of fattening the animal.
#: {{ux|en|Due to BSE, cows in the United Kingdom must be '''finished''' and slaughtered before 30 months of age.}}
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To come to an end.
#: {{ux|en|We had to leave before the concert had '''finished'''.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To put an end to; to destroy.
#: ''These rumours could '''finish''' your career.''
# {{lb|en|intransitive|sex}} To reach [[orgasm]].
#* {{quote-web|en|date=14 June 2019|author=Macaela Mackenzie|author2=Lindsay Geller|title=Why Your Orgasm Is MIA—And Exactly What To Do About It|work=Women's Health|url=https://www.womenshealthmag.com/sex-and-love/a19954247/why-can-t-i-climax/|archivedate=25 January 2021|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20210125014819/https://www.womenshealthmag.com/sex-and-love/a19954247/why-can-t-i-climax/|text="Understand the anxiety around sex and what beliefs are triggering it," says Van Kirk."Are you worried you aren't good in bed? That you'll come off as selfish? That pleasuring you will take too long? Reframe that anxiety. Your excitement needs to be louder than any anxiety" to '''finish'''.}}

